{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.CategoricalDynamics","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.CategoricalDynamics","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Category.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Functor.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Limits.Shapes.Terminal"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDynamics.functorialFlowPoint","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDynamics.functorialFlowPoint","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalDynamics.lean#L47-L49","doc":"The functorial flow of a point morphism under the TimeFunctor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDynamics.particleStateAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDynamics.particleStateAt","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalDynamics.lean#L39-L41","doc":"The state of a particle at a given point. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDynamics.ParticleSection.is_section","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDynamics.ParticleSection.is_section","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalDynamics.lean#L37-L37","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDynamics.ParticleSection.section_map","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDynamics.ParticleSection.section_map","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalDynamics.lean#L36-L36","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDynamics.ParticleSection.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDynamics.ParticleSection.mk","kind":"ctor","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalDynamics.lean#L35-L35","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDynamics.ParticleSection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDynamics.ParticleSection","kind":"structure","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalDynamics.lean#L32-L37","doc":"A Particle is conceptually a section over points. \nGiven a bundle projection π : E ⟶ M, a section is a morphism s : M ⟶ E \nsuch that s ≫ π = 𝟙 M. Over a specific point p, the particle has a state p ≫ s. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDynamics.flowPoint","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDynamics.flowPoint","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalDynamics.lean#L28-L30","doc":"A 'flowed' point is the composition of the original point morphism with the time step. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDynamics.PointMorphism","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDynamics.PointMorphism","kind":"def","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalDynamics.lean#L21-L23","doc":"A Point is a morphism from the terminal object (pt) to M.\nCategorically, we avoid geometric coordinates. ","signatureChunk":0}]}